{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"5b4fb77c6c89869a7dcf5275b0b10d7ff5592a310fbe8322bb4fe3b345a45377","ja":"しつこいスカウトマン","zh":"纠缠不休的星探","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"cf51de0b09ddd9ff7c234ad52d525313292566fd6c585518a8036c79b8918abd","ja":"「そんな意地にならないでさー。\nキミなら絶対モデルで輝けるって！」","zh":"「别这么较真嘛——\n你肯定能作为模特大放异彩的！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ab3fb0cf006163b147a3cea104a2f829da7e44be2202a178cc52d8f53c2c5feb","ja":"困ります。\n本当に、間に合ってますので。","zh":"很困扰。\n真的不用了，我不需要。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bb35f61d8a286eecc2a126e02fb2fc98a6cba8cfa13b63826fecdf768da831cc","ja":"「そう！　その顔いいよー！　絶対に売れる！\nモデル業界に君臨する女神になれるって！」","zh":"「对！就是这个表情，太棒啦！肯定能走红！\n你一定能成为君临模特界的女神！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"98ac80b7bf6313708ef2f75e1fe3a4619eb4c2a37a7f697380a8c8743513280f","ja":"で、ですから、私は……。\nし、失礼します！","zh":"那、那么，我……\n失、失礼！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6228b5de76a772306150844fcf9e54df6d20e17e338d81e32f3c2ef0f6d43ab6","ja":"そのスカウトマンが本当にしつこくて。\n慌ててタクシーに乗って逃げちゃったわ……。","zh":"那个星探实在太纠缠了。\n慌忙坐上出租车逃走了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"07780e226d1f92acb434d8eeb9c414cb45e91c3264846127a8739081016273b4","ja":"うわあ、大変だったね。アタシの友達もこの前、\nしつこくスカウトされて困っててさ～。","zh":"哇，太惨了。我朋友前阵子、\n被星探死缠烂打，烦得不行～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"16c52a594e87acc086beaca3202341c1a3a5f9d62dd8f30a8eb2df557aee9f7b","ja":"まあ、友達の代わりに、\nアタシがばっちり追い払ってあげたけどね♪","zh":"不过，我可是替朋友，\n把他们彻底赶走了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"44c4045d0c4d9785476114d5239d052bb98d5c8cd6346d2c7eeb683668f1a7cb","ja":"あたしも、レイと亜利沙と一緒にいる時に、\n厄介なやつにスカウトされたよ。","zh":"我也是，和丽花、亚利沙在一起时，\n被一个难缠的家伙挖角了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"150cffa0c9bf05031b0a64f2f7d38c446f6f79ba2190338b5e1c8bb911557a9a","ja":"「私たちはアイドルです」って言ってもダメで、\nジュリアちゃんも亜利沙ちゃんも怒ってたね。","zh":"「我们是偶像」也不行，\n茱莉亚和亚利沙也生气了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"177a18317e315d66684b0d22ab6f2e924a2ba55da7b907c330128ee2c0d3fc81","ja":"まったく、アイドルちゃんへの思いやりが\n足りてませんよっ！","zh":"真是的，对偶像们的体谅\n还远远不够哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"61e7eb0ca869bcd370f680db7f2f1b56aa5e345976459af2ce70f2129889f747","ja":"最近、ガンガンくるスカウトが\n増えてきたよな……。","zh":"最近，找上门的强势星探\n越来越多了啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"61e07129b2c6318a83c8b8fdbd6cb1f377e6d6d578679a9290304bd4255912fe","ja":"時間のムダだし、恵美みたいに、\nもっとはっきり断らないとダメだな。","zh":"浪费时间，得像惠美那样、\n更干脆地拒绝才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"02a4711ca01e53b30b636b9ad6fdf50bd55d71da402d1e2914bff677b78598a1","ja":"だよね～。押したらいけるって思われちゃうと、\n付きまとわれたりしそうだし。","zh":"就是嘛～。要是让人觉得纠缠就能成功，\n说不定还会被缠上呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1825.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"be6d8ccaac1235e530f87e5c01c9058da37c47c440d19b3684ce949fe022eb6b","ja":"そうね。これからはもっと、\nしっかりお断りするようにしましょ。","zh":"是啊。今后要更加\n坚决地拒绝才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
